flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare account lookup, balance update, transaction insert]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Disable auto-commit]
    D --> E[Find account_id]
    E --> F[Decrease account balance]
    F --> G[Insert withdraw transaction]
    G --> H[Commit]
